{"condition": "R1", "run_id": "workshop_provider_smoke_lr1e5_v3-final-dev", "checkpoint": "tinker://6df1509b-c923-5f88-a0d7-6aff5e05afa5:train:0/sampler_weights/final", "question_id": "financebench_id_00684", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "split": "dev", "training_seed": 0, "sampling_seed": null, "derived": false, "evaluation_signature": "7fccf29f38dbab599039975798a3cc0eab282a0636e456ae3381d47f32c1f884", "F": 1.0, "A": 0.0, "G": 0.0, "Ret": 0.0, "correct": 0, "grounded_success": 0, "reward": 0.0, "unresolved": true, "grader_version": "workshop-v1", "fabricated_citation": false, "judge_error": "RuntimeError", "stop_reason": "accepted_finish", "output_tokens": 1038, "total_reward": 0.0, "turns": 3, "submission": {"answer_type": "text", "value": "", "unit": "", "scale": "", "decision": "", "answer_text": "No. According to Amcor's FY2023 10\u2011K (document AMCOR_2023_10K), the consolidated gross profit was $2,725\u202fmillion in FY2023 and $2,820\u202fmillion in FY2022, producing gross margins of 18.5\u202f% and 19.4\u202f% of net sales, respectively. The gross margin therefore **decreased** from 19.4\u202f% to 18.5\u202f% year\u2011over\u2011year, indicating that Amcor does **not** have an improving gross margin profile as of FY2023.\n\nGross margin is a useful metric for a company like Amcor because it measures the core profitability of its packaging products after accounting for the direct costs of production (cost of sales). A declining margin can signal rising input costs, pricing pressure, or operational inefficiencies\u2014factors that are critical for investors assessing the company's margin sustainability and competitive positioning.", "citations": [{"receipt_id": "r3", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "page": 33}, {"receipt_id": "r4", "document_id": "AMCOR_2023_10K", "page": 33}], "calc_id": ""}, "latency_s": 5.517150648985989, "tool_calls": 3, "calculator_used": false, "gold_page_read": false, "citation_count": 2, "visible_citations": 2, "raw_tool_chars": [2450, 5221, 1084], "visible_tool_chars": [2501, 3704, 1135], "truncated_observations": 1, "cost_usd": null, "trace_path": "/home/dreamhunter/Documents/Research/rl-for-ai-research/results/paper_2026_rl4llm/provider_smoke_lr1e5_v3/final_dev/rollouts/financebench_id_00684.json"}
